	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050030"},
		line=1005,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Pushed along in my wheelchair by Akari, I have nothing else to do but take in the red-tinted foliage all around us.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"It's as though I've leapt through time, the midsummer Tenkyo vista I last saw seeming now like a distant memory.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Some warrior I am, not even able to walk on my own.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's no rush. You'll be better in no time.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We will do our utmost to see to your recovery, so you may rest assured.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"My companions lower themselves down to my eye level to deliver their words of comfort.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, shall we trade places?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You must be tired from pushing the wheelchair this whole time.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Kotone offers, reaching over to grasp the handles of my wheelchair.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nah, no need. I'll be just fine.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've got to be tired from using your magicks, so let me handle this.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is terribly unfair for you to keep him all to yourself!”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nuh-uh! I'm just doing my part!”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"My ride suddenly becomes considerably bumpier as the two of them start jostling behind me.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"What in the world are they doing?",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Have we decided our next move after I recover my strength?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Pardon?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A-Ah, that's right.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"The two of them stop and turn towards me with stiff expressions.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Like I mentioned yesterday, Tenkyo is under Republican occupation, and we don't have any allies to rely on.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm not about to raise the white flag, though.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course. I'm not gonna throw in the towel either.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If I gave up on restoring the Empire here, I'd never be able to face our fallen comrades.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"The fire burning in Akari's eyes hasn't dimmed in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Though our situation is dire, I'm glad to see that she hasn't lost her spirit.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Though the question is what exactly we're gonna do.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If only we'd managed to take the Three Sacred Treasures with us...”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"The Three Sacred Treasures...",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"I think back to that mysterious dream I saw right before I woke up.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"That dream involving Himi-no-Mikoto, Inou Tooru, Shiinoha Chihaya... and Mitsurugi.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"It was far too vivid, far too poignant to dismiss as a simple dream.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"It must contain some deeper meaning. I'm sure of it.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I haven't mentioned this to anyone yet...”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But before I woke up, I saw a certain dream.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're not exactly asking us to divine your future with it, are you?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I think it might be important. It's a bit of a long story, though. Is that okay?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"The two nod their heads, and I begin recounting the contents of my dream.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In this dream, I was not Tokita Soujin, but someone else.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My name was... Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“An existence born of Himi-no-Mikoto's magicks, created for the sole purpose of waging war.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"In the distant past, before even the time of the Empire─",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"As the very survival of her realm hung in the balance, Himi-no-Mikoto sacrificed the souls of eight hundred and eighty-eight priestesses to create Mitsurugi.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Far beyond a mere blade, the existence known as Mitsurugi was an undying avatar of destruction.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Though human in form, his was nothing more than to stand upon the battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Mitsurugi brought ruination upon any who would threaten harm to the Empire, all for the sake of his creator.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"And even after Himi-no-Mikoto's death, he continued to follow the path she ordained, preserving the Empire from all calamity befalling it.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Patiently awaiting the day her soul, finding an end to its long sojourn, finally returns to this world.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Could you be suggesting that you and Mitsurugi-sama... are the same person?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even though all this happened two thousand years ago?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It was all just a dream, so I can't say for sure.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But if I really am Mitsurugi, that would explain my unnatural healing abilities.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It would also explain why your spellcrest is different from that of any other warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Moreover, you were immune to the Republican Army's magicks during the battle at the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even though all the other warriors suffered its effects.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"That's a good point. As I recall, Rochel said it was a spell specifically intended to incapacitate warriors.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Yet I was completely unaffected.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“To the extent of my knowledge, I cannot think of any other explanations for what you might be.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I am personally inclined to believe that the dream you saw is indeed a vision of the past.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even still...”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Kotone seems convinced, but Akari still has a look of perplexity on her face.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Though I must say, the Founding Empress's magicks are even more fearsome than I could have imagined.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I could not even begin to fathom the process involved in creating an ageless defender of the realm.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, perhaps 'create' was not the right word. By no means did I intend to suggest that you are a mere object, Soujin-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't worry about it.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A warrior ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"is",
{"/font"},
" a mere blade of their lord. And if anything, I think it'd be better to be an object if it means not having to have any extraneous thoughts.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A warrior is their lord's blade ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"metaphorically,",
{"/font"},
" all right?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't wanna ever hear you treating yourself like an object again!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why are you so upset?”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It just pisses me off.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you really are just an object, I might as well be a lord who gets jerked around by her own furniture!”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Have I been doing that?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You seriously haven't noticed?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Akari grumbles with a sullen pout.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please, please, you two, I do believe we have strayed quite far from the original topic.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Guess you're right.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So, why did you call me Himi-no-Mikoto yesterday?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're the spitting image of her.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Indeed, Akari's delicate features and dignified demeanor are a perfect living replica of the Himi-no-Mikoto from my dream.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Th-That's just a coincidence, isn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Her tears also turned into peach petals, just like yours.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The two of you have the same face and the same special power.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Doesn't it only make sense that there's a connection between you two?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I mean, you say 'connection,' but...”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Think back to Himi-no-Mikoto's last words.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She promised Mitsurugi that she would return some day, and bade him to protect the Empire until that day comes.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're saying that the Founding Empress came back as ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"me?",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's a real possibility, at least.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
{"font", size=53},
"“When the two of us first met this spring, I felt this... awakening inside of me? I don't know how to describe it, but it felt like the fates themselves had brought us together.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't you think it's possible that even though I lost my memories, I still hadn't forgotten about Himi-no-Mikoto?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't think it's a coincidence, either, that I lost consciousness as soon as I touched your tears.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Am I really... the Founding Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Akari slowly turns her hands over, staring at them as though they belong to a stranger.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In that case... do you mean to say that you are Mitsurugi-sama, and Akari-sama is the reincarnation of Her First Majesty?!”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, we can't say for sure just─”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What an ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"honor",
{"/font"},
" this is!”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“To think that one such as I might be standing in the presence of the two greatest figures in all the Empire's history!”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This humble priestess is touched beyond all words!”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Kotone immediately bends forward to knock her forehead to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Cut that out! We don't know anything for sure yet!”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, no, no, no, I am all but convinced.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“The two of you are positively brimming over with mysteries that defy all ordinary logic.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ooh...”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“W-Well, I suppose... It's not like I'm in any position to tell an expert magicker that she's mistaken, after all...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Akari admits, nodding to herself.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“By the way, the Three Sacred Treasures showed up in my dream as well.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"This immediately catches their attention, and I proceed to explain what I learned about the Treasures.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
{"font", size=49},
"The Artifacts known to all Imperials as the Three Sacred Treasures are nothing more than a pure fabrication added to the Imperial Chronicles by Mitsurugi and the second Exalt-Priestess.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"This was done to preserve the three true relics of power from the grasp of those with tinsel dreams of dominion.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"The first Artifact─the looking-glass of Ko no Kuni─should still be securely enshrined within the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"The second Artifact is the magatama left behind by Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"This should still be sealed away in the Shireiden.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"And the third and final Artifact, Mitsurugi... would appear to be myself.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So what we thought were the Treasures are actually just decoys?”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I expect that none but the Empress herself would have ever known the truth.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Guess I can't blame Okonogi for not knowing, either.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“By the way, what sort of powers does the looking-glass have?”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There was nothing about it in my dream.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Same for Himi-no-Mikoto's magatama. All I know is that it was left behind after her death.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But we do know all that we need about Mitsurugi-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“He is the ageless defender of Hi no Kuni who single-handedly stood against the heathen hordes!”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Now that you mention it, assuming Soujin really is Mitsurugi, he'd be the best ally we could ever ask for.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Mitsurugi of legend should be able to easily take on the whole Republican Army!”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"The two stare admiringly at me, their eyes brimming with expectation.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm glad you have such high hopes for me... but just look at how I am now.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"I sink down a little lower into my wheelchair.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Plus, even when my injuries heal, there's no guarantee I'll be able to live up to the Mitsurugi of legend.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Basically, I guess I'm saying that at the end of the day, I'm still just Tokita Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mh... If you put it that way, I suppose you're right.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Kotone, do you know of any way to make Soujin more like Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Hmm, Okonogi-sama's final words do come to mind.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“'Go to Iseya... and hone Mitsurugi,' was it?”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Perhaps the chancellor knew of Mitsurugi-sama's existence.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If that was indeed the case, the answer should surely be found here in Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"When I first heard Okonogi's words, I only focused on the part about fleeing to Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"But thinking about it again, perhaps the part about honing Mitsurugi was the real message.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"If so, it's only natural to expect the answer lies somewhere here in Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“While you're at it, could you look into me as well?”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If I had the same power that the Founding Empress did,\nI'd be able to blow away the whole Republican Army with a flick of my finger!”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Of course, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I will need to ask for some of your time that I may examine your bodies, so I hope you will not be opposed to that.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Course not. I'll do whatever I need.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“After all, the fate of the Empire is resting in the balance.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Mitsurugi, the legendary savior of the realm, and Himi-no-Mikoto, the greatest priestess that ever lived.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"If we could unlock their powers, we just might be able to defeat the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"With our blades broken and our quivers empty, so to speak, even a bare possibility such as this is nothing short of a blessing from Oomikami.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"We have no other choice but to grasp at it with everything\nwe've got.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Akari softly calls out to me from the other side of the sliding screen door.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Mine and Akari's rooms are separated by nothing more than this single sheet of rice paper.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"It's a design you often see in older Imperial architecture.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you're still awake, can I come over?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, go ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Akari pushes the screen door aside and steps into my room.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The moon is awfully pretty tonight.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The moon in Iseya, huh? I'd love to get a better look.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Akari lends me her arm, and we slowly step outside into the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Hanging high above in the night sky, the refulgent glow of the full moon is impeded only by a few wispy clouds drifting about like smoke.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Here in the mountains, without any other sources of illumination nearby, its light is much brighter than I'm used to.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm glad we get to spend time like this again.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry I worried you.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you start apologizing now.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If it weren't for you, I would've gotten captured by the Republic for sure.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Besides, I'm just really happy that you're alive right now.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm so glad that I didn't lose you.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Her sincere words fill me with joy.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"But it still remains a fact that our uprising was crushed only because we failed to fulfill our duty as warriors.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"How pathetic I am for suffering such an ignominious defeat and exposing my lord to mortal danger.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"If Mitsurugi had stood in my place, even an entire division of Republican soldiers would have amounted to nothing...",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If only I could grasp Mitsurugi's true power.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you really think you might be Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I couldn't say either way. But I do hope so.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What about you? Do you think you could be Himi-no-Mikoto?”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nope, not at all.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
{"font", size=47},
"“I mean, there are definitely some things I can't explain, like how my tears are flower petals, or how I can activate spellblades... but isn't it a bit of a stretch to believe I'm someone else's reincarnation?”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But just like you, I do hope that I really am the Founding Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"For some time, Akari and I silently stare into each other's eyes.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Who are you looking at, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You know, um... do you see the Founding Empress... or Miyaguni Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course I see you, Akari. You're you and no one else.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Still, didn't you call me Himi-no-Mikoto when you first woke up?”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, I was dreaming right up until then.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...A horrible dream I never want to see again.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"Mitsurugi was forced to cut down Chihaya by his own hand─",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"And to watch helplessly as Himi-no-Mikoto died in his arms.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Even now, the mere act of recollection threatens to crush my heart with grief.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"I've certainly experienced my fair share of nightmares before, but I've always been able to dismiss them as mere figments of my imagination.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"However, the dream I saw of Himi-no-Mikoto is different.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"No matter how much I try to tell myself that it's just a dream, the pain wrenching my chest refuses to dissipate.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"It stabs into my heart time and again, each time seemingly an admonition to ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"remember what happened.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What sort of relationship did Mitsurugi and the Founding Empress have?”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Lord and vassal, I suppose. She was his creator, and he her tool.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmmm? Is that all?”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's all.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"That was a lie─Mitsurugi and Himi-no-Mikoto knew each other far more intimately than lord and vassal ever should.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"But I decide to hide this truth from Akari.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Even though the affairs of Mitsurugi ought not to concern me, I want to keep this part of his life all to myself.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Not out of a sense of propriety or shame, make no mistake.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
{"font", size=51},
"But because as soon as I reveal the truth of their relationship to another, I feel like the lingering memories of that dream, still burning bright within my breast, will surely lose their luster.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"I know myself just how unreasonable it is to attach such significance to a mere dream, but still, I'm unable to change how I feel.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's a strange thing to be concerned about.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, assuming we really are the Founding Empress and Mitsurugi... I was just, you know, trying to get a clue about what we're supposed to do.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't have any memories of the past, and I've lived my whole life up until now as myself.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It doesn't matter what relationship they might have had in the past. You should just act as your current feelings dictate.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have no intentions of trying to act out the past, either.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The only truth I know is what my feelings are telling me in the present.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That makes sense. I'll do just that.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"Akari turns towards me with a bright expression.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know you're still trying to work through that dream you saw, but I just wanted to make sure...”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You still see me as your lord, right?”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Immediately, the corners of her lips quirk upwards into a wide smile.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"I am Akari's vassal, and she is my lord. That fact will never change.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"Yet even as I affirm this conviction, a recollection of the past flits through the corner of my mind.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"Unbidden, I think back to the time I saved Akari back in spring.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Amaranthine eyes.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Efflorescent Persica lips.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"I... I know this girl.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"─Don't kill her.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"I hear a whisper in the back of my ears.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"─Don't kill her.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"─Protect this girl.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"The whisper turns into a deafening voice that thrums through my whole body.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"It's the voice of my instincts.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"A voice of absolute authority given shape by the very depths of my essence.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"─Don't kill her.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"─Protect this girl.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"─",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"That is your purpose.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"At the time, I didn't yet believe that Akari was the Imperial Princess.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Despite that, however, I was compelled to protect her by all my being.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"If Akari truly is Himi-no-Mikoto, and I truly am Mitsurugi─",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"If, after two thousand years, the fates saw fit to bring Mitsurugi face-to-face with his one and only lord─",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Then, there would be absolutely no mystery as to why I needed not even think about saving Akari.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"No other outcome could ever have come to pass.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"But if all that is true, who is it that I serve now?",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"Is it Akari, or is it Himi-no-Mikoto?",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"No, I shouldn't waste my time thinking about this.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"Doing so won't accomplish anything.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"I am a warrior. A blade that exists only to serve my lord, Akari.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"That is all I need to know.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Achoo!”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The wind is really picking up, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"A susurrus of chill autumn wind sets the trees astir.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"It's as though the mountains themselves are trembling in fear of the coming winter.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"I hope I can unlock Mitsurugi's power before the first snowfall...",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“C'mon, let's go back inside.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, can't afford to catch a cold now.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"Once again, Akari takes me by the arm and leads me back to my room.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
